        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-406, Southwest Floral Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Southwest Flower with Square Pattern Cabinet Pull features geometric shapes that make-up and flatter the floral design in the center and ends. The interesting combination of shapes is aesthetically pleasing to the eye. It is the perfect accent to almost any ranch or southwest style home. Available in 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/southwest-flower-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-206\"><b>CK-206 Southwest Flower Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-406 Flower Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
